<title>USA: TENNIS-FRIDAY'S RESULTS FROM THE U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRIDAY'S RESULTS FROM THE U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the U.S. Open tennis championships at the National Tennis Centre on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's doubles, final</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge and Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat 8-Jacco Eltingh and Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 4-6 7-6 (7-5) 7-6 (7-2).  </p>
<p>Women's singles, semifinals</p>
<p>2-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat 4-Conchita Martinez (Spain) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>16-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) leads 1-Steffi Graf (Germany)</p>
<p>1-0 (suspended because of rain)</p>
</text>
